                  What is IoT fleet Management?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  The use of IoT in fleet management enables fleet operators to automate many processes, including
                  trip planning. These systems collect data such as the route, traffic, vehicle speed and a number of
                  passengers to generate alerts and display messages which help passengers plan their journeys.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                  What is Fleet Tracking in the IoT?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Fleet tracking uses location technology to track vehicles. Software programs that collect data from
                  vehicle location devices allow you to pinpoint your vehicle's exact position.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                  What is smart fleet management?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Smart fleet management is a combination of fleet management technologies that are used to manage,
                  maintain and achieve the best possible fleet operations. It allows digital technology to be applied
                  for maintenance and fuel management, driver safety, telematics and tracking, as well as smart
                  surveillance.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                  How can I become a fleet manager?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  A high school diploma or GED certificate is required to become a fleet manager. A majority of fleet
                  managers jobs require an associate's degree in a relevant field, as well as several years of
                  experience in the transportation and logistics industry.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
